            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasengisithi: Hawu, Nkosi Nkulunkulu! Khangela, abaprofethi babatshela bathi: Kaliyikubona impi, kaliyikufikelwa yindlala, kodwa ngizalinika ukuthula kulindawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kimi: Abaprofethi batshumayela amanga ngebizo lami. Kangibathumanga, kangibalayanga, kangikhulumanga kibo; batshumayela kini imibono yamanga, lokuvumisa okuyize, lenkohliso yengqondo zabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalokhoke iNkosi ithi mayelana labaprofethi abatshumayela ngebizo lami bona ngingabathumanga, abathi: Impi lendlala kakuyikufika kulelilizwe. Labobaprofethi bazaqedwa ngumkhonto lendlala; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuthi abantu abatshumayela kibo baphoselwe endleleni zeJerusalema, bebulewe yindlala lempi, kungasekho muntu wokubangcwaba, bona labomkabo, lamadodana abo lamadodakazi abo. Ngoba ngizakwehlisela ububi babo phezu kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
